---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Mail from '../components/Mail.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy · Tolbxela" description="Privacy policy for tolbxela.com">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="muted">What this site collects, in plain terms.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    With your consent, this site loads <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami</a> for anonymous,
    aggregated visit statistics. Umami does not use cookies, does not collect personal data,
    and does not store full IP addresses. Data is hosted by Umami Cloud.
  </p>
  <p>
    The consent choice itself is cookieless: it is stored in your browser's <code>localStorage</code>
    under <code>tolbxela-analytics-consent</code>. If you decline, the Umami script is not loaded
    and no analytics request is sent.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site does not set any cookies.</p>

  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    If you use the contact form, the details you submit are sent to Web3Forms so the message can
    be delivered by email. Do not include sensitive information in the form.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, email <Mail user="admin" />.</p>
</Base>
